# Per-machine UI state, not vault machinery. Tracking workspace.json meant every
# pane move showed up as a change — the reason this history has "fix" / "clean" /
# "vault backup" commits.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/plugins/home-tab/data.json

# NOTE: 00 - Config/_obsi/assets/ is deliberately NOT ignored. image_upload copies
# your own maps and portraits there and writes full-path wikilinks into notes, so
# ignoring it would make every uploaded image a broken embed on a fresh clone.
#
# The rest of .obsidian/ stays tracked on purpose: the QuickAdd, metadata-menu,
# Templater and dataview configs are the vault's machinery, and a wizard that
# loses its macro definition is a broken vault.
